email.applied.text.text:
Hello {{name}},

Thank you for applying for {{job}}. You can follow your application, and withdraw it, here:
{{link}}

email.assessment.text.text:
Hello {{name}},

The next step is an assessment. Start it here:
{{link}}

email.builtin.interview_confirmation.bod.text:
Hello {{first_name}},

Your {{interview}} for {{job}} is confirmed.
Where: {{where}}

If that time no longer works, ask for a change from your page:
{{link}}

We look forward to meeting you.
{{sender}}
{{company}}

email.builtin.interview_invitation.body.text:
Hello {{first_name}},

{{company}} would like to meet you for a {{interview}} about {{job}}. Pick ten times that suit you; every one already fits the team’s calendars. We will confirm one of them by email.

The link works for fourteen days.

{{sender}}
{{company}}

email.builtin.offer.body.text:
Hello {{first_name}},

We are delighted to offer you the role of {{job}}. Read the offer, and accept or decline it, on your page:
{{link}}

{{sender}}
{{company}}

email.builtin.rejection.body.text:
Hello {{first_name}},

Thank you for applying for {{job}} and for the time you gave us. We will not be taking your application further this time.

We would be glad to hear from you again for a role that fits, and we wish you well in your search.

{{sender}}
{{company}}

email.builtin.selection.body.text:
Hello {{first_name}},

Thank you for your application for {{job}}. We would like to take it to the next step: {{stage}}.

We will be in touch shortly with what happens next. Everything about your application is on your page:
{{link}}

{{sender}}
{{company}}

email.builtin.stage_expectations.body.text:
Hello {{first_name}},

Your application for {{job}} is now at {{stage}}. Here is what to expect:

{{expectations}}

If anything is unclear, reply to this email and we will help.

{{sender}}
{{company}}

email.contract.team_signed_body.text:
{{name}} signed the contract for {{job}} and is hired, starting {{start}}.

Next: send their account invitation, now or on a date you choose, from their profile. They confirm the details already on file and add what is missing, and become an employee in onboarding.

{{link}}

email.offer.team_accepted_contract.text:
{{name}} accepted version {{version}} and is in the contract stage now.

Next: prepare the contract. Open their profile and the contract card: Kithena drafts it from the accepted terms and the law of {{entity}}, you check every fact, and send it to sign.

{{link}}

email.pool_ask.text.text:
Hello {{name}},

{{company}} would like to keep your application on file and contact you about future roles. You can agree, or say no, on your page:
{{link}}

email.pool_renew.text.text:
Hello {{name}},

You agreed that {{company}} may keep your details for future roles until {{until}}. To stay, renew on your page; otherwise we remove you then:
{{link}}

